            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The silver dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n\u2022 Frost (arcane, cold, evocation); The dragon breathes a cloud of frost in a 30-foot cone that deals 10d6 cold damage (DC 29 basic Reflex save).\n\u2022 Paralyzing Gas (arcane, enchantment, incapacitation); The dragon breathes a blast of paralyzing gas. Each creature within a 30-foot cone must succeed at a DC 29 Fortitude save or be slowed 1 for 1 round (or paralyzed for 1 round on a critical failure)."
            },
